# Write one feedforward scalar (firmware CMD_SET_FF_SCALAR).
#
# Read it back with get_feedforward_scalar before trusting it: the firmware clamps
# silently and ACKs the clamped value.

int32 item             # see litearm::Arm::ff_scalar_items()
int32 sub              # only meaningful for items 5 and 6 (0..2)
float64 value
---
bool success
string message
